# Copy to .env.local. Never commit it.
# API location. The default (/api) is proxied to http://localhost:8000 by vite.config.ts (the prefix is stripped).
# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Where the dev/preview proxy points (read by vite.config.ts, not exposed to the browser).
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:8000
# Start in mock mode: no backend, fixed example payload, flagged "MOCK DATA" everywhere. ?mock=1 does the same per page load.
# VITE_API_MOCK=1
